<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-odd-meter-rhythm" category="High Gain" order="200" instrument="guitar" style="Prog Metal">
  <description>Clear, articulate prog metal rhythm: a light gate and a gentle overdrive into a cascaded boutique Plexi-style head at medium-high gain, into a V30 4x12. Enough saturation for heavy riffs in odd meters, with the note separation to keep stacked and extended chords readable.</description>
